1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,263
Bagaimana Jerman menaklukkan Prancis hanya dalam enam minggu?

2
00:00:03,273 --> 00:00:04,049
Jawabannya:

3
00:00:04,059 --> 00:00:05,671
Blitzkrieg, perang kilat.

4
00:00:05,681 --> 00:00:08,438
Sebelumnya, Perang Dunia Pertama macet di parit.

5
00:00:08,448 --> 00:00:10,974
Empat tahun, garis depan nyaris tak bergerak.

6
00:00:11,006 --> 00:00:12,021
Jerman belajar.

7
00:00:12,031 --> 00:00:14,751
Heinz Guderian dan rekan-rekannya memadukan tank,

8
00:00:14,761 --> 00:00:15,992
pesawat, dan radio,

9
00:00:16,058 --> 00:00:17,941
untuk menghantam cepat di satu titik.

10
00:00:17,951 --> 00:00:20,446
September, seribu sembilan ratus tiga puluh sembilan.

11
00:00:20,456 --> 00:00:21,615
Polandia diserang.

12
00:00:21,656 --> 00:00:23,486
Stuka menghantam dari udara,

13
00:00:23,496 --> 00:00:24,954
panzer menerobos pertahanan.

14
00:00:24,964 --> 00:00:26,074
Mei tahun berikutnya,

15
00:00:26,084 --> 00:00:28,993
panzer melintasi hutan Ardennes yang dianggap mustahil,

16
00:00:29,003 --> 00:00:30,230
memutari Garis Maginot.

17
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,772
Sekutu terkepung di Dunkirk,

18
00:00:31,782 --> 00:00:33,670
dan Paris jatuh pada empat belas Juni.

19
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:34,967
Tapi di Uni Soviet,

20
00:00:34,977 --> 00:00:35,942
kilat itu padam.

21
00:00:35,952 --> 00:00:37,452
Wilayahnya terlalu luas,

22
00:00:37,462 --> 00:00:39,819
logistik kewalahan, dan musim dingin datang.

23
00:00:39,829 --> 00:00:40,631
Pelajarannya:

24
00:00:40,641 --> 00:00:42,738
kecepatan bisa memenangkan pertempuran,

25
00:00:42,748 --> 00:00:44,664
tapi belum tentu memenangkan perang.
